@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam shadowing false
title DELETE /api/workspace/v1/messenger/drafts/{draft_uuid}
actor "Клиент" as Client
participant "Контроллер RestAlchemy" as API
database "Строка черновика в PostgreSQL" as DB
queue "Внутренний доменный outbox" as OUT
queue "delivery_snapshot_event\ninternal/no public derivative" as TASK
Client -> API: DELETE + If-Match
API -> DB: BEGIN; заблокировать и сравнить ревизию
API -> DB: физически удалить черновик
API -> OUT: добавить внутреннее draft.deleted
API -> DB: COMMIT
OUT -> TASK: immutable delivery_snapshot_event(outbox_event_uuid)
note right of TASK: effect guard; завершить без public event row
API --> Client: 204 пустой ответ
@enduml
